msgid "Single sign-on failed"
msgstr "单点登录失败"

msgid ""
"Unable to complete single sign-on. The login link may have expired or "
"already been used."
msgstr "未能完成单点登录，登录链接可能已过期或已使用。"

msgid ""
"Return to the platform that opened this link and start sign-in again. If the"
" problem persists, contact the administrator."
msgstr "请返回发起登录的平台，重新发起单点登录。如仍无法登录，请联系管理员。"

msgid ""
"The single sign-on link is incomplete. Please start sign-in again from the "
"original platform."
msgstr "登录链接不完整，请从原平台重新发起单点登录。"

msgid ""
"Single sign-on is currently unavailable. Please contact the administrator or"
" use another sign-in method."
msgstr "单点登录暂不可用，请联系管理员，或使用其他方式登录。"

msgid "Back to login"
msgstr "返回登录"

msgid ""
"First login password change is unavailable for this user. Please contact "
"the administrator."
msgstr "当前账号无法完成首次登录的密码设置，请联系管理员。"
